<title>MACEDONIA: MACEDONIA STOCK VOLUME, TURNOVER RISE.</title>
<headline>MACEDONIA STOCK VOLUME, TURNOVER RISE.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover rose to 1.048 million</p>
<p>denars at Tuesday's session of the Macedonian Stock Exchange</p>
<p>from 51,410 denars on Thursday as only one company traded, the</p>
<p>exchange said.</p>
<p>Alkaloid joint stock company sold 1,080 shares at 970</p>
<p>denars, unchanged from Thursday's close and below par of 2,424</p>
<p>denars.</p>
<p>Traded volume was 53 stocks at the previous session when</p>
<p>only Alkaloid shares traded.</p>
<p>Listed companies trade in two floor sessions. The exchange</p>
<p>trades on Tuesday and Thursday.</p>
<p>($1=45.06 denars; 1DEM=26.64 denars)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-981 4145</p>
</text>
